:: Light the candle - Intro {"position":"600,325","size":"100,100"}
<img src="https://64.media.tumblr.com/887796ad6c0038206aaa3195b46943b4/527e9990a7192707-98/s2048x3072/f68d970831f44c493782b99266a831a6e0d45d98.pnj" width="666" height="auto">
